    "tpa_score_new": "<ol>\n\t<li>The make-up tests are given for the students who are having either the justification or the written request for the absence of midterm or final exam. If the students do not have the reasonable justification for the absence, the maximum score of the make-up test is 60.</li>\n\t<li>The class attendance will be taken into consideration for giving the bonus.</li>\n\t<li>The students get failed if any cheating behavior or plagiarism occurs in the course.</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<ol>\n\t<li>The make-up tests are given for the students who are having either the justification or the written request for the absence of midterm or final exam. If the students do not have the reasonable justification for the absence, the maximum score of the make-up test is 60.</li>\n\t<li>The class attendance will be taken into consideration for giving the bonus.</li>\n\t<li>The students get failed if any cheating behavior or plagiarism occurs in the course.</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "course_pol": "1. 學生準時到課，並全程參與課程。\n2. 期望學生上課能動手做筆記，將老師板書內容做整理與記錄，方便課後自行學習。\n3. 我會透過課堂小測驗做點名，做為期末加分之參考。",
    "course_pol_en": "1. Students are expected to attend all lectures.\n2. I will also encourage you to take your own lecture notes in class, and that will be helpful on your self-learning.\n3. Notice that I will take attendance almost every class. The amount of the extra bonus that I give to students depends on the attendance record.",
    "course_rem": "1. 請隨時注意放置在iLearn平台上，老師自製之課程大綱內容或是考師資訊，以便掌握學期授課與考試進度。\n2. 期望學生課前能先預習老師事先上傳之講義。\n3. 提醒學生要出席實習課程，助教會提供許多練習題，而那些題目或多或少會出現在期中考或期末考試中。",
    "course_rem_en": "1. All the course materials are provided on iLearn platform, please take advantage of them for self-learning.\n2. Please review the lecture note before you attend the class.\n3. Please remember to attend TA review session, in which TA will provide students a lot of practice questions.",
    "ais_meno": "<ol>\n\t<li>在課堂中學習，期望學生能夠準時到課，並把老師的板書做記錄，以便課後複習之用。</li>\n\t<li>另外，在課堂中，請勿大聲言談；若有急事需要講(電)話，請到教室外溝通。</li>\n\t<li>關於回家作業，同學們可以共同討論後作答，但請勿複製他人作業內容。</li>\n\t<li>至於期中(末)考試方面，請勿作弊；一旦發現違規者，成績以零分計算。</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1. Regardign the homework assignment, please do not copy-and-paste any content, figure or anything written by your classmates or someone else.</div>\n\n<div>2. Your score is counted as zero if any cheating behavior during the midterm or final exam is occurred.</div>\n\n<div>3. Please attend the class on time and please do not skip or leave the class earlier.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
